00:02:04.585 --> 00:02:06.838
So, just a dude you met
from another country

00:02:06.838 --> 00:02:09.090
that you'll never see again
ever again in your life.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.763
- Yeah.

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:10.749
