00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:43.392
Okay.

00:02:43.392 --> 00:02:45.196
So we did it. We totally did it.

00:02:45.196 --> 00:02:46.544
We were only out here for about an hour,

00:02:46.544 --> 00:02:48.208
