00:02:54.102 --> 00:02:55.182
What did we learn here today?

00:02:55.182 --> 00:02:57.434
Some people are very
protective of their passwords.

00:02:57.434 --> 00:02:58.351
Most people don't give a (bleep).

00:02:58.351 --> 00:03:00.106
If you want a password,
and you don't want to pay,

00:03:00.106 --> 00:03:02.738
